:HL["https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/New-Project.jpg","image"]
3:T43ba,<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6757 " src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Screenshot_20240508-130618_Instagram-947x1024.jpg" alt="" width="440" height="476" /></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">The recent Zomato’s video is way beyond just a promotional tool but rather a blend of so many emotions, entertainment, engagement, and a subtle reminder for each one of us. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Most of us are bound to forget important events amid daily happenings but guess what? Here&#8217;s Zomato taking over the responsibility of being your reminder friend, evolving into being </span><strong>“A reminder app”</strong><b><span data-contrast="auto">.</span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">What caught our attention was their social media post captioned, </span><i><span data-contrast="auto">“Career Update: We’re now a reminder app”</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h3>Breaking Down Zomato’s Creative Strategy for Mother’s Day 2024</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Well, with calendars flipping each month, brands get into tight competition with groundbreaking and innovative strategies and a variety of eye-catching advertisements, offers, social media posts, reels, etc. While this quite naturally prompts towards their successful branding and <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/social-media-marketing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">social media marketing</a> efforts. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><iframe loading="lazy" title="Mother&#039;s Day is on 12th May | Zomato" width="500" height="281" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/LLNpPIIO5Jc?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>
<h2>Here’s Top 5 Aspects that Zomato Pulled Out Absolutely Right With This Video:</h2>
<h3>1: Emotion:</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">A short two-minute video</span> <span data-contrast="auto">is enough to speak volumes and evoke emotions. The Video’s approach has an emotional, funny, empowering yet spookily hilarious touch to it. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559683&quot;:0,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1">
<h4>Emotional Appeal &#8211;</h4>
</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-medium wp-image-6759 aligncenter" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Screenshot_20240508-130305_Instagram-1-242x300.jpg" alt="" width="242" height="300" /></p>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559683&quot;:0,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1">
<h4><span class="TextRun SCXW11185701 BCX0" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW11185701 BCX0">Humor Appeal-</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW11185701 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></h4>
</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-medium wp-image-6760 aligncenter" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Screenshot_20240508-130329_Instagram-241x300.jpg" alt="" width="241" height="300" /></p>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559683&quot;:0,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1">
<h4><span class="TextRun SCXW221796001 BCX0" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW221796001 BCX0">Unexpected </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW221796001 BCX0">Spooky</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW221796001 BCX0">&amp;</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW221796001 BCX0">Humorous Visuals</span></span></h4>
</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-medium wp-image-6762 aligncenter" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Screenshot_20240508-130639_Instagram-241x300.jpg" alt="" width="241" height="300" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-medium wp-image-6761 aligncenter" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Screenshot_20240508-171407_Instagram-300x225.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="225" /></p>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/social-medias-influence-on-urging-voters-impact-of-online-engagement/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Social Media’s Influence on Urging Voters: Impact of Online Engagement</a></p>
<h3>2: Influencer Marketing</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Understanding your target audience is the key to any good marketing strategical approach. Zomato here is targeting the current children coming from a tech-savvy/ tech-using generation who are already familiar with <a href="https://www.zomato.com/mobile" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Zomato&#8217;s application</a>. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-medium wp-image-6764 aligncenter" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Screenshot_20240508-130525_Instagram-242x300.jpg" alt="" width="242" height="300" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-medium wp-image-6763 aligncenter" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Screenshot_20240508-171429_Instagram-1-243x300.jpg" alt="" width="243" height="300" /></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">However, Collaborating/Featuring an influencer is what drew more attention. The advertisement features –Arpit Bala (Youtuber and influencer), Ranveer Allahbadia (Youtuber and podcast host), and the very famous Johnny Lever (Actor). </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Coming together with such popular personalities among people surely helps boost your advertisement&#8217;s viewership. In fact, most of the comments under the video say, Here for Arpit Bala! Well, that is an excellent way to catch more attention and draw engagement to the post.  </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h3>3: Use of Memes &amp; Popular Dialogues</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Memes are already ruling the internet, and our maximum screen time is spent on social media watching reels and memes. Thats exactly what Zomato used in their reel video. It also has funny gigs, and famous movie lines that have added a funny, quirky touch to the advertisement.  </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">And Zomato nailed it with featuring popular memes and gigs.</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-6766" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Screenshot_20240508-130536_Instagram-242x300.jpg" alt="" width="242" height="300" /> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-6767" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Screenshot_20240508-130329_Instagram-1-241x300.jpg" alt="" width="241" height="300" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-6765" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Screenshot_20240508-171429_Instagram-1-1-243x300.jpg" alt="" width="243" height="300" /></p>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/can-you-use-memes-in-advertising-perks-of-meme-marketing/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Can You Use Memes in Advertising? Perks of Meme Marketing </a></p>
<h3>4: Channel of Communication:</h3>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-6768" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Screenshot_20240508-230539_YouTube-163x300.jpg" alt="" width="163" height="300" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-medium wp-image-6769" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Screenshot_20240509-010317_Instagram-169x300.jpg" alt="" width="169" height="300" /></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Using the right communication channel helps achieve the right results and enhances sales. Zomato marked its presence on Youtube and Instagram through this advertisement while successfully reaching out to its targeted audience. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Our social media Maestro, Shreya, feels, “The ad truly maintained its essence in celebrating and reminding us about Mother&#8217;s Day until the very end, holding a grip with the right use of storytelling, communication, elements, characters, and humour.” Good job, team Zomato. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">The video received praise from viewers shocked by Aarpit Bala&#8217;s cameo presence and people who appreciated the ad’s funny approach. Some were seen appreciating and loving this reminder edition of their Zomato application.  </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/online-paid-advertising" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn how PPC can be helpful for your business</a></p>
<h3>5: CTA Because Conversions are Crucial!</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">An impactful CTA lures viewers into taking the necessary action. The ad also illuminates the reminder element newly added to your respective Zomato application. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-medium wp-image-6770 aligncenter" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-20240508-WA0002-300x181.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="181" /></p>
<p><span class="TextRun SCXW230193686 BCX0" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW230193686 BCX0">Well, what makes a customer happy? </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW230193686 BCX0">Yes, amazing d</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW230193686 BCX0">iscount codes</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW230193686 BCX0">! The ad shows their marketing &amp; growth team </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW230193686 BCX0">deciding</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW230193686 BCX0"> on </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW230193686 BCX0">giving discounts. So now you know </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW230193686 BCX0">you&#8217;re</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW230193686 BCX0"> not just getting a reminder </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW230193686 BCX0">from Zomato </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW230193686 BCX0">but also discounts to celebrate this </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW230193686 BCX0">Mother’s Day</span> <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW230193686 BCX0">in its true essence with rewarding offers. </span></span><span class="EOP SCXW230193686 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-medium wp-image-6771 aligncenter" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Screenshot_20240508-170932_Instagram-241x300.jpg" alt="" width="241" height="300" /></p>
<h2>Conclusion</h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Zomato has always had its marketing game strong with creative reels, post, memes, deals, advertisements, creative copies and app notifications. Through this advertisement, we see how important it is to focus on little details which communicate with the audience.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">For more such case studies and blogs on the latest updates in the digital world, </span><span data-contrast="none">visit our blog page</span><span data-contrast="auto">.  For collaboration with our creative <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/digital-marketing-agency-in-thane" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Digital Marketing Agency in Thane</a>, connect with us soon on </span><span data-contrast="none">collabs@theimpulsedigital.com</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
